Package: molpathR
Title: Molecular Pathology Data Platform for Clinical NGS Integration
Description: Ingests, links, queries and visualizes molecular pathology data
    from heterogeneous sources, including next-generation sequencing (NGS)
    files (FASTQ, BAM, VCF), XML variant interpretation reports, structured
    pathology reports in PDF format, exports from pathology and clinical
    information systems, and survival outcome data. Provides a searchable
    in-memory database and an interactive 'shiny' application for clinical
    exploration and cohort analysis. Raw sequence and alignment readers do not
    perform variant calling or clinical interpretation. The optional
    'Bioconductor' packages 'Rsamtools', 'ShortRead' and 'Biostrings' are
    used when installed.
Version: 0.2.0
